From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] feat(microsoft): Graph drafts from MIME, sent by id

POST /v1.0/me/messages creates a draft from MIME, and
POST /v1.0/me/messages/{id}/send sends it, moving it to Sent Items with
its id kept; a folder's messages can be listed, filtered by
internetMessageId.

---
diff --git a/apps/web/content/docs/microsoft.mdx b/apps/web/content/docs/microsoft.mdx
--- a/apps/web/content/docs/microsoft.mdx
+++ b/apps/web/content/docs/microsoft.mdx
@@ -16,9 +16,12 @@
 - `GET /:tenant/oauth2/authorize` - v1 (Azure AD) authorization endpoint: the v2 page, with the `resource`'s default scope
 - `GET /v1.0/me/mailFolders`, `GET /v1.0/me/mailFolders/:folder`, `GET|POST /v1.0/me/mailFolders/:folder/childFolders`, `POST /v1.0/me/mailFolders` - mail folders, by id or well-known name (`inbox`, `sentitems`, ...)
 - `GET /v1.0/me/mailFolders/:folder/messages/delta` - a folder's changes, through `@odata.nextLink` / `@odata.deltaLink`
+- `GET /v1.0/me/mailFolders/:folder/messages` - a folder's messages; `$filter` by `internetMessageId eq '…'` only
 - `POST /v1.0/me/mailFolders/:folder/messages` - create a message from MIME (base64, `text/plain`)
+- `POST /v1.0/me/messages` - create a draft from MIME, in Drafts
 - `GET|PATCH|DELETE /v1.0/me/messages/:id`, `GET /v1.0/me/messages/:id/$value`, `POST /v1.0/me/messages/:id/move` - messages and their MIME source
 - `POST /v1.0/me/sendMail` - send MIME or a JSON message, delivering to seeded recipients
+- `POST /v1.0/me/messages/:message/send` - send a draft, which keeps its id in Sent Items
 - `GET /oauth2/v2.0/logout` - end session / logout
 - `POST /oauth2/v2.0/revoke` - token revocation
 
